{
  "Combat.Helspawn.CalledShot.DrawsBackHer": "{0} draws back her bowstring, spending an extra second aiming before letting fly!"
  "Combat.Helspawn.CalledShot.OneOfHer": "\nOne of her arrows smacks right into your [leg], nearly bowling you over. God DAMN that hurt! You're going to be limping for a while!"
  "Combat.Helspawn.CalledShot.YouAvoidThe": "\nYou avoid the hit!"
  "Combat.Helspawn.HelSpawnBerserk.LetsOutA": "{0} lets out a savage warcry, throwing her head back in primal exaltation before charging back into the fray with utter bloodlust in her wild eyes!"
  "Combat.Helspawn.HelSpawnFocus.SeeingAMomentary": "Seeing a momentary lull in the melee, {0} slips out of reach, stumbling back and clutching at the bruises forming all over her body. [say: Come on, {0}, you can do this. Focus, focus,] she mutters, trying to catch her breath. A moment later and she seems to have taken a second wind as she readies her weapon with a renewed vigor."
  "Combat.Helspawn.HelSpawnShieldBash.HerShieldCatches": "\nHer shield catches you right in the face, sending you tumbling to the ground and leaving you open to attack!"
  "Combat.Helspawn.HelSpawnShieldBash.LashesOutWith": "{0} lashes out with her shield, trying to knock you back!"
  "Combat.Helspawn.HelSpawnShieldBash.TheHitStuns": " <b>The hit stuns you.</b>"
  "Combat.Helspawn.HelSpawnShieldBash.YouEvadeThe": "\nYou evade the strike."
  "Combat.Helspawn.HelspawnTwinStrikes.LeapsBackOut": "{0} leaps back out of your reach and nocks a pair of blunted arrows, drawing them back together and loosing them at once!\n"
  "Combat.Helspawn.HelspawnTwinStrikes.LungesAtYou": "{0} lunges at you, scimitar cleaving through the air toward your throat!\n"
  "Combat.Helspawn.SluttyMander.JumpsJustOut": "{0} jumps just out of reach before spinning around, planting her weapon in the ground as she turns her backside to you and gives her sizable ass a rhythmic shake, swaying her full hips hypnotically."
  "Combat.Helspawn.SluttyMander.WhatTheFuck": "\nWhat the fuck is she trying to do? You walk over and give her a sharp kick in the kiester, [say: Keep your head in the game, kiddo. Pick up your weapon!]"
  "Combat.Helspawn.SluttyMander.YouLeanBack": "\nYou lean back, enjoying the show as the slutty little salamander slips right past your guard, practically grinding up against you until you can feel a fire boiling in your loins!"
  "Combat.Helspawn.TailWhipShitYo.STailCatches": "\n{0}'s tail catches you as you try to dodge. You hear a sizzling sound from your [armor] and leap back with a yelp as she gives you a light burning."
  "Combat.Helspawn.TailWhipShitYo.WhipsAtYou": "[pg]{0} whips at you with her tail, trying to sear you with her brilliant flames!"
  "Combat.Helspawn.TailWhipShitYo.YouEvadeThe": "\nYou evade the strike."
}
